{"overview":"اوی-جو، دانش‌آموزی آرام در روز و نویسنده‌ای رمان‌های عاشقانه در شب، با ظهور چهار معلم زیبا الهام می‌گیرد: وو-سو یخی، دا-جو سرزنده، جی-جئون خشن و دونگ-جوی مهربان. او این الهامات را در رمان جدیدش می‌نویسد که یک شبه منفجر می‌شود! اما راز او توسط وو-سو، بدترین دشمنش از روز اول، کشف می‌شود. او معامله او را برای محافظت از رازش می‌پذیرد، اما آیا می‌تواند این رمان را بدون آسیب به پایان برساند؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"High schooler Yeo Eui-ju secretly writes web novels by night. When four charming new teachers arrive, they inspire her stories and shake up her school.","tagline_en":"","runtime":40,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":1,"y":null,"poster":""},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":16,"y":2026,"poster":"/rPAJvXgB6hVS5exhFbMIJizbYm0.jpg"}],"episodes":16,"crew":["Lee Tae-gon","김준형","이민주"],"crew_en":["Lee Tae-gon","Kim Jun-hyung","Lee Min-joo"],"countries":["KR","SG"],"cast":[{"name":"김향기","role":"Yeo Eui-ju","photo":"/fjxmH4T3JAVVNvGkBHVwpqE0JZo.jpg","en":"Kim Hyang-gi"},{"name":"차학연","role":"Ga Woo-soo","photo":"/wI2xhjCXyWOWnH9iQK8PnGwLuEL.jpg","en":"Cha Hak-yeon"},{"name":"김재현","role":"No Da-ju","photo":"/wuhVSzn7zU5p6gBTaN46otqO9am.jpg","en":"Kim Jae-hyun"},{"name":"손정혁","role":"Jeong Gi-jeon","photo":"/xEArWURRsIJ3Bcd9QGHavT3ejxj.jpg","en":"DEMIAN"},{"name":"김동규","role":"Yoon Dong-ju","photo":"/nu2LzbuN6l03YVvgtmAfBvshItc.jpg","en":"Kim Dong-kyu"}],"trailer":"XzqfAg0ZNHg","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/314784/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLpMHwVxfqeux2g.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/tpwTT1FpWqLLhxUfAuDavIXDDfI.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/314784/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Amazon Prime Video","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/gMZdpavHmxFNnLpMHwVxfqeux2g.png"},{"n":"Amazon Prime Video with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/tpwTT1FpWqLLhxUfAuDavIXDDfI.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/314